[GENERIC-CONFIRM] REUSABLE CONFIRMATION OVERLAY
             +------------------------------------------+
             | Are you sure you wish to do this?       |
             |                                          |
             |           [ YES ]     [ NO ]             |
             +------------------------------------------+

Suggested uses: disband unit, sell building, declare war, quit game,
launch spaceship, change government, spend treasury, abandon action.
